  "website": "https://www.pickyourown.org/AME2email.php?ADDT=UPDN&amp;EN=Beddington+Ridge+Farm&amp;ES=ME&amp;EC=Washington+County&amp;EP=+207-638-2664&amp;ECT=Beddington&amp;EZ=&amp;EA=Route+193&amp;EA2=&amp;EW=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.beddingtonridgefarm.com&amp;RD=NR&amp;EF=beddingtonridgefarm&amp;EM=rcvarin%40rivah.net&amp;EX=US&amp;PG=MEne.htm&amp;OP=in+dry+weather+August+and+September%2C+call+for+hours%3B%3B+&amp;IG=&amp;TW=&amp;DS=Pick+your+own+wild+blueberries+using+your+rakes+or+ours.+Winnow+and+pick+over+the+berries+using+a+modern+cleaning+machine.+Please+call+ahead.+Restroom+available.+.+Small+farm+in+Eastern+Maine+produces+perennial+plants%2C+cut+flower+bouquets%2C+assorted+jams%2C+wild+blueberries%2C+dried+flower+wreaths+and+Christmas+wreaths.+Comments+from+a+visitor+on+August+15%2C+2008%3A+%22This+place+is+great%21+It%27s+in+the+middle+of+the+wild+blueberry+barrens+of+Maine.+I+could+have+purchased+wild+blueberries+in+a+couple+of+dozen+places+on+the+way+up+from+Mass.+But+it+was+worth+the+drive+to+experience+picking+lowbush+berries+with+a+blueberry+rake.+Ron+the+owner+was+awesome%21+He+showed+us+how+to+use+the+rakes%2C+and+then+after+we+picked+our+boxes+full%2C+Ron+brought+our+berries+over+to+his+berry+cleaning+machine.+Boy+was+that+fun+to+watch%21+I+have+always+liked+lowbush+wild+berries+better+than+the+cultivated+highbush+ones.+Just+make+sure+you+call+or+e-mail+Ron+before+you+go+up+there+so+he+will+be+expecting+you.%22&amp;DR=+",
